00%"><p>Big Ideas Start Early.</p></span></div><div data-rid="a8ed34f2-b4b1-4c49-b7f1-a825e778f54e" class="r-159l0md alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Give your kids stories that entertain and teach them how the world really works.<br>The Tuttle Twins Book Club delivers age-appropriate books each month that spark curiosity, critical thinking, and a love of learning without preaching or politics.</p></span></div><div data-rid="3b073c12-fba0-4d11-92e1-b2d383de384d" class="r-zbchp8 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Give your kids stories that entertain and teach them how the world really works.</p><p><br>The Tuttle Twins Book Club delivers age-appropriate books each month that spark curiosity, critical thinking, and a love of learning without preaching or politics.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="8cf24746-e872-4465-a581-5bb29214711a" class="r-ajix7r"><div data-rid="5e387fc2-c49a-4794-ab9d-2cd422c17f8b" class="r-kizoah"><picture data-rid="ab5a995c-75cd-4692-b58c-2b54401a6cb6" class="r-67wzsn"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/7eec8342-6696-4e3b-b0ba-0509570e3b24?width=80" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/7eec8342-6696-4e3b-b0ba-0509570e3b24?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/7eec8342-6696-4e3b-b0ba-0509570e3b24?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/7eec8342-6696-4e3b-b0ba-0509570e3b24" class="r-e617qk" loading="lazy"/></picture><div data-rid="b90c89c2-464b-413b-a0cd-00f938766d44" class="r-1b0salx"><div data-rid="917032c8-c061-410b-b70a-5dec3f340630" class="r-1tsns9i alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Fun to Read</p></span></div><div data-rid="0b47258f-4c38-48f5-a682-4d7c175cbb64" class="r-3zfo99 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The original book has great lessons, but we explain them in simple language with fun characters and clear examples kids can follow.</p></span></div></div></div><div data-rid="54e2b341-6651-423b-b6ee-a48fac4f4fea" class="r-1gzsj2a"><picture data-rid="cfa705e4-66f7-4ca5-bae4-6767c075ec1b" class="r-h1umyi"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/eb9f72f5-56c0-4271-b9e9-2dcb8c299977?width=80" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/eb9f72f5-56c0-4271-b9e9-2dcb8c299977?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/eb9f72f5-56c0-4271-b9e9-2dcb8c299977?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/39afbdbf-870a-4720-a8f6-e9e8bd9d26aa/eb9f72f5-56c0-4271-b9e9-2dcb8c299977" class="r-s5dysp" loading="lazy"/></picture><div data-rid="3a79b099-07d6-45c1-9374-339436b8a705" class="r-a72frn"><div data-rid="ac52e0d1-02cb-49ab-8b1d-9e16065b6d94" class="r-1ku24dd alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Designed to Stick</p></span></div><div data-rid="4587e29b-8628-4dda-984d-f15fb28753c1" class="r-1leansy alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Instead of long, dense text, Tuttle Twins uses exciting stories that make the lessons stick and feel real in everyday life.</p></span></div></div></div></div><button data-rid="89761971-b52e-4032-9cab-a40f10a04d15" tabindex="0" role="link" class="text r-lhvn8o alchemy-rte"><div data-rid="88984e46-43ca-4656-8c90-b1130eea3b5c" class="r-ayyeu7 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Shop Book Club</p></span></div></button></div></div></div><div data-rid="ce91dfb4-a471-4a0b-a8cb-5dc5f4191b64" class="r-12kqxi1"><div data-rid="637f55a8-2fbb-428d-a302-ebed5970adb6" class="r-kjzfwt"><div data-rid="88ad340c-a02b-4e19-bac6-470255fdd758" class="r-3mv4a8"><div data-rid="daa8d4a9-e0ad-422a-bc33-07acd869dbd6" class="r-tb439w alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Frequently Asked Questions</p></span></div><div data-rid="991c7113-656d-4386-b4bd-dd5bbbcd555a" class="r-5le8fz" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="1ba8ffe2-ccf0-4a09-8167-c1ba19f177eb" class="r-p9u2z" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="c3e9e750-0d17-4c24-bd0e-bd1eaecba820" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="replo-:Rcqb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1lrrnvi r-13k1wap"><div data-rid="b2d0a6c5-13ae-481c-ba69-8331b2181cda" class="r-gpadlg alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What ages are the books for?</p></span></div><div data-rid="f865feaa-42f1-4ed8-a291-a885e82c3c14" class="r-aqzjgz" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-mm0vqj" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M4 8a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5h7a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-7A.5.5 0 0 1 4 8"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" id="replo-:Rcqb2:"><div data-rid="c04026a4-b7c1-404a-9039-de0e6729aead" class="r-qy6mq3"><div data-rid="a9e90119-ca3e-408b-bfca-9b964c6e1c7b" class="r-1cgiia6 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Our “sweet spot” is ages 5–12, but we have books for every stage of growing up — from toddler board books that teach simple values, to storybooks and chapter books that make big ideas fun and easy to understand, all the way up to teen guides that explore real-world topics. Many parents love reading the books together with their kids, helping spark great conversations and making learning a family experience.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="060ca096-1d21-4809-b7ff-e6d86058b842" class="r-srb447" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="03095d71-eb34-4dd6-87b5-b0c08f41a011" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rkqb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-b21841"><div data-rid="e078c92f-70b2-4c04-ad7a-1fd773908321" class="r-14hlmbx alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>What kinds of concepts do the books teach?</p></span></div><div data-rid="c8e0e65b-59fa-4e0d-a581-71bd4cea1fa2" class="r-110xeiu" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-ci0cr" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Rkqb2:"><div data-rid="124d2dff-8f5a-4f32-81dd-ccbaf8b6f5a6" class="r-11cow0u"><div data-rid="a6139557-7f53-48df-815f-78b1bec6f1b3" class="r-175li4t alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>These stories introduce kids to freedom-based ideas like individual liberty, free market economics, personal responsibility, critical thinking, entrepreneurship, and real-world history—wrapped up in fun, age-appropriate adventures.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="a6fdaa5b-4c43-4e8e-8a5e-7a901aa64946" class="r-1wnxbgx" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="01a80301-de0d-48d3-bf74-e9309b622e8f" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:Rsqb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-16t5ya0"><div data-rid="db186e8c-9ee9-4d18-9bad-9fc6bbdff925" class="r-wdhiww alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Are the activity workbooks downloadable or printed?</p></span></div><div data-rid="fdaeb419-a08d-4921-99da-9f53c96887e9" class="r-aoid8e" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-dc1l67" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Rsqb2:"><div data-rid="24982c13-9f70-4023-87e4-21b1da0e40cd" class="r-1t25hpx"><div data-rid="aa3a20fa-b8ff-4c9d-adde-933af06dbc07" class="r-1kfq6ae alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The activity workbooks are delivered as digital PDF files that you can download immediately after purchase. These printable companions to your physical books allow families to print as many copies as needed—perfect for multiple kids or reusing over time.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="f0d80fef-933c-4396-8d61-8ee599d59983" class="r-hyd1lv" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-rid="ad97989d-0a34-426b-9f72-304f5ba56c62" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R14qb2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-q7y00w"><div data-rid="08105326-937f-4bf5-811a-8a06a2f7c595" class="r-q1qa0b alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Is there a refund policy if it’s not the right fit?</p></span></div><div data-rid="a75c34d5-31ef-4a70-aef1-8863241c54ac" class="r-1i2otsk" aria-hidden="true"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="img" aria-label="Collapse/Expand" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:auto;max-height:100%" class="r-1428hvr" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M8 4a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v3h3a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1h-3v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3h-3a.5.5 0 0 1 0-1h3v-3A.5.5 0 0 1 8 4"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R14qb2:"><div data-rid="71e87767-c20a-4add-a595-8329a5750fc3" class="r-in9usc"><div data-rid="b973933d-70d9-4e7f-bd12-9869ec397482" class="r-170gbug alchemy-rte"><sp